		{"id":"incoming_qc","type":"text","text":"## 🔍 来料质检\n[[06-质检部操作指南]]\n在「来料质检任务」中质检","x":-620,"y":400,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"qc_pass","type":"text","text":"## ✔ 合格\n→ 入库申请","x":-920,"y":680,"width":220,"height":80,"color":"2"},
